section.k-page
  section.k-demo
    h2.k-demo__title Default
    div.k-preview.k-preview--block
      div.ui-empty-state
        span.ui-dashboard-stat-icon
          span.k-icon.k-icon-folder.k-icon-lg
        strong No projects yet
        p You have not created any projects yet. Get started by creating your first one.
        div.k-row(style="margin-top: 12px")
          button.ui-button.ui-button-default(type="button") Create project
          button.ui-button.ui-button-outline(type="button") Import project
  section.k-demo
    h2.k-demo__title Search without results
    div.k-preview.k-preview--block
      div.ui-empty-state
        strong No results found
        p Try adjusting your search or filter to find what you are looking for.
        button.ui-button.ui-button-link.ui-button-sm(type="button") Clear filters
